# INVWINY.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: DEL on an item
# asks first, its default answer No: ENTER or N keeps the item, Y
# deletes it, the list fetched again with its selection on the same row,
# or on the last when the last row went; the end by Exit.  The ENTER of
# the P line, typed with the first DEL, which the list has taken before
# the question opens, is dropped under it: the question stays alone, no
# form over it.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINY.SNP is its snapshot.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER
K DOWN DEL
P ENTER
S ASK
K ENTER
S KEPT
K DEL N
S NO
K DEL Y
S DELETED
K DEL Y
S LAST
K ALT-F X
